<div class="accordion">
    <div class="accordion-item active"><div class="accordion-header"><h5><?= t('What is Marvel Rivals Win Boosting?') ?></h5></div><div class="accordion-content" style="display:block;"><p><?= t('Choose the number of competitive wins you want, your current rank, and the preferred service options. A Marvel Rivals specialist completes the purchased victories in Competitive mode.') ?></p></div></div>
    <div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header"><h5><?= t('Can I choose Solo or Duo Win Boosting?') ?></h5></div><div class="accordion-content"><p><?= t('Solo lets the booster play on your account. With Duo, you remain on your own account and queue together with the booster. Available modes and surcharges are displayed directly in the order summary.') ?></p></div></div>
    <div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header"><h5><?= t('Can I select heroes or roles for my wins?') ?></h5></div><div class="accordion-content"><p><?= t('When selection is enabled, you can request Vanguard, Duelist, or Strategist preferences and choose from the available hero pool. More flexibility generally produces better team compositions and faster results.') ?></p></div></div>
    <div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header"><h5><?= t('What happens if the booster loses a match?') ?></h5></div><div class="accordion-content"><p><?= t('A lost match is not counted as a purchased win. The service continues until the selected number of victories has been delivered under the order terms.') ?></p></div></div>
    <div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header"><h5><?= t('Can I watch my Marvel Rivals Win Boost?') ?></h5></div><div class="accordion-content"><p><?= t('Select Stream Games when available to watch the booster live. You can follow the order and communicate with the booster at any time through your customer dashboard.') ?></p></div></div>
    <div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header"><h5><?= t('What does Priority do for a Win Boost?') ?></h5></div><div class="accordion-content"><p><?= t('Priority gives the order faster assignment and handling. Matchmaking times, current rank, and booster availability can still affect the final completion time.') ?></p></div></div>
</div>
